Create a modern React + TypeScript web app for Norway electricity planning using the Hvakosterstrommen.no API.

Features:
- Fetch live hourly electricity prices for NO2 region
- Show prices in a clean chart
- Highlight cheapest and most expensive hours
- Let users choose:
  - Dishwasher
  - Washing Machine
  - Dryer
- Suggest the cheapest time to run each appliance
- Show estimated cost for running the appliance
- Use a modern Nordic-style UI
- Mobile responsive
- Use Tailwind CSS
- Use Recharts for visualization
- No backend
- Ready for Netlify deployment
